========================================================================
RULES
========================================================================

( [T3] runtime_metadata_twiddling: overwriting undo/restart from a RULE -
  Each twiddleable command (noundo, norestart, ...) reads everything to
  its right as its value and stops parsing that line right there, same
  as "message" does. That means you CANNOT chain two of them, or a
  twiddle and a message, on one rule's output - each needs its OWN
  separate rule matching the same pattern. All of them still fire on
  the same turn; PuzzleScript just accumulates commands from every rule
  that matched, not only the first one. "set" (or any word besides the
  two magic ones below) turns a flag on; "wipe" deletes it (turns it
  back off); "default" restores whatever the Prelude originally said. )

[ Player Seal ] -> [ Player Seal ] noundo set
[ Player Seal ] -> [ Player Seal ] norestart set
[ Player Seal ] -> [ Player Seal ] message Sealed - no undo, no restart until you reach Unseal.

[ Player Unseal ] -> [ Player Unseal ] noundo wipe
[ Player Unseal ] -> [ Player Unseal ] norestart wipe
[ Player Unseal ] -> [ Player Unseal ] message Unsealed - undo and restart both work again.

( -- next: [T4] )

( [T4] three more in-RULE commands vanilla doesn't have -------------- )
( undo: fires a REAL undo, same stack Z uses, from inside a rule.       )
( nosave: this turn's result never gets pushed onto the undo stack, so  )
( there is nothing there for Z to rewind back to once you're past it.  )
( quit: leaves the level for the level-select menu (since level_select )
( is set above) or the title screen otherwise. )

[ Player RewindTile ] -> [ Player RewindTile ] undo

[ > Player | Bridge ] -> [ > Player | Water ] nosave message The bridge is gone behind you - nosave means Z can't rebuild it.

[ Player MenuButton ] -> [ Player MenuButton ] quit message Back to the level-select you go.

========================================================================
WINCONDITIONS
========================================================================

Some Player on Exit

